@Sofia Marchetti, the right number is 10%. I've replied in the thread under your message.

Bettina's 12% in November was a misread, and she corrected it to 10% in the same channel that day. The 10% retention discount is in Amendment 1 to the Saltmarsh agreement, signed 2025-10-20 and effective 2025-11-01. The 2026 renewal order form carries that 10% over unchanged.

For the exact figures in the renewal brief, check with June Osei-Lark on the deal desk, since she holds the signed paperwork.
